{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_36FF00","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，正在运输的核武器已经穿过湿地，似乎抵达了Irazú山区。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"但我们现在没有向导。在山区继续追踪会更加困难。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"所以你得潜入他们其中一个据点——战俘收容所。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"希望Amanda的弟弟Chico平安无事……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"是啊。那里说不定还关着其他<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>成员。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"要把他们带回MSF，就使用“富尔顿回收系统”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"Snake应该已经亲身体验过了，这套系统不会对人体造成影响。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"毕竟我们可没有时间一个个慢慢说服他们。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"Snake，能听我说一下吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":32,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"Amanda？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"CIA那些人征用了村里的几栋房子当收容所。Chico应该就在其中某一栋。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"村里的房子吗……。可要怎么分辨？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"被征用的房子为了监视，门都被换过了。是蓝色的门，上面有窥视窗。从那里确认里面的情况。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"知道了。蓝色的门，对吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"物资运输路线的最后一个据点已经很近了。拜托你了，Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""}]}